    <briefdescription>
<para>Base interface representing the hydrological and thermal properties of a terrain cell. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class specifies:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>how moisture sources are applied to a cell,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>how temperature and relative humidity are updated,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>how the maximum resource capacity of a cell is computed and retrieved,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>how the cell integrates into global environmental cycles.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Implementations must define all pure virtual functions, encapsulating the specific behavior of the moisture model.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="class_moisture_source" kindref="compound">MoistureSource</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="class_terrain_cell" kindref="compound">TerrainCell</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
